abstract: >
  Two linked independent research projects. The first is a covering
  location analysis of ambulance station placement in Astana under
  Kazakhstan's ten minute emergency response standard, using p-median,
  MCLP, and MEXCLP formulations. The second reconstructs regional measles
  immunity gaps in Kazakhstan by comparing administratively reported
  vaccination coverage against susceptibility implied by outbreak size,
  using an SEIR model and the epidemic final size relation. See
  PROTOCOL.md for the full research protocol.
